Whole-application acceptance, project membership/CRM ceilings, module and Privacy enablement, Agency storage/history, native UI/T25/FA-DE-EN/RTL/accessibility, provider delivery and release remain open. Source, private controls, runtime inputs, the historical source packet, ledgers, progress/main plans and Git state were left untouched by this documentation capture.
